    palette: pair interiors use 1-2 non-background colors drawn from {1,2,3,4,5,6,8} (not equal to frame color or bg colors)
    pixel_count: each pair interior has 3-32 non-zero pixels; s1.s and s1.d pixel counts may differ (e.g. endpoints/fill)
  test_sprite (s2):
